OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786432689
OL,3,CRail company fined #1.2m after elderly
OL,4,Cman seriously injured from wall
OL,5,Ccollapse
OL,7,FNetwork Rail has been fined #1.2
OL,8,Fmillion after a wall at Rugby station
OL,9,Fcollapsed and seriously injured an
OL,10,Felderly man.
OL,12,FRegulator the Office of Rail and Road
OL,13,F(ORR) said it prosecuted the
OL,14,FGovernment-owned company after a
OL,15,Fboundary wall beside a car park fell
OL,16,Fon to Edward Hanlon, then 81, who was
OL,17,Fwalking along the adjacent alleyway.
OL,19,FMr Hanlon suffered several fractured
OL,20,Fribs, a punctured lung and a blood
OL,21,Fclot in his lung.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786432689
OL,3,CRail company fined #1.2m after elderly
OL,4,Cman seriously injured from wall
OL,5,Ccollapse
OL,7,FThe ORR said the incident in September
OL,8,F2022 had a "lasting impact" on him
OL,9,Fphysically and mentally, leaving him
OL,10,Fin "persistent pain" and preventing
OL,11,Fhim from returning to "many of the
OL,12,Factivities he had previously enjoyed".
OL,14,FMr Hanlon died in January 2025 after a
OL,15,Fdiagnosis of lymphoma, which is a type
OL,16,Fof blood cancer.
OL,26,@pD@LOUpD@[O]rD@DOUrD@TO]sD@WOUtD@eO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786432689
OL,3,CRail company fined #1.2m after elderly
OL,4,Cman seriously injured from wall
OL,5,Ccollapse
OL,7,FNetwork Rail owned the wall and was
OL,8,Fresponsible for its maintenance, but
OL,9,Fthe installation of a fence in front
OL,10,Fof it by a previous tenant led to the
OL,11,Fmistaken assumption that the fence
OL,12,Fmarked the station boundary, the ORR
OL,13,Fsaid
OL,15,FThe wall was consequently omitted from
OL,16,FNetwork Rail's inspections, and its
OL,17,Fdeteriorating condition was not
OL,18,Fidentified, according to the regulator.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786432689
OL,3,CRail company fined #1.2m after elderly
OL,4,Cman seriously injured from wall
OL,5,Ccollapse
OL,7,FThe ORR said Network Rail was fined
OL,8,F#1.2 million at Birmingham
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court on Friday after
OL,10,Fadmitting an offence under health and
OL,11,Fsafety at work legislation.
OL,13,FRichard Hines, the ORR's HM chief
OL,14,Finspector of railways, said: "Our
OL,15,Fthoughts remain with Mr Hanlon's
OL,16,Ffamily and friends.
OL,26,@vD@^OU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786432689
OL,3,CRail company fined #1.2m after elderly
OL,4,Cman seriously injured from wall
OL,5,Ccollapse
OL,7,F"The sentence imposed by the court
OL,8,Freflects the seriousness of Network
OL,9,FRail's failings and the devastating
OL,10,Fconsequences when infrastructure is
OL,11,Fnot managed effectively.
OL,13,F"Duty holders must know which assets
OL,14,Fthey are responsible for, carry out
OL,15,Fappropriate inspections, and take
OL,16,Ftimely action to address defects
OL,17,Fbefore they pose a risk to people.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786432689
OL,3,CRail company fined #1.2m after elderly
OL,4,Cman seriously injured from wall
OL,5,Ccollapse
OL,7,F"This prosecution sends a clear
OL,8,Fmessage that ORR will not hesitate to
OL,9,Ftake enforcement action where failures
OL,10,Fto manage safety expose workers or
OL,11,Fmembers of the public to serious harm."
OL,13,FGary Walsh, route director for Network
OL,14,FRail, said: "We are deeply sorry for
OL,15,Fthe incident at Rugby station in
OL,16,FSeptember 2022, for the injuries
OL,17,Fsuffered by Mr Hanlon and the distress
OL,18,Fcaused to his family.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@gO]vD@MOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786432689
OL,3,CRail company fined #1.2m after elderly
OL,4,Cman seriously injured from wall
OL,5,Ccollapse
OL,7,F"Following the incident, we reviewed
OL,8,Fthe circumstances surrounding the
OL,9,Fwall, took action to address the
OL,10,Fimmediate risks and strengthened
OL,11,Fprocesses relating to asset records,
OL,12,Fboundary identification and inspection
OL,13,Fmanagement.
OL,15,F"While incidents of this nature are
OL,16,Frare, we remain committed to
OL,17,Fcontinually improving the safety of
OL,18,Four infrastructure for passengers,
OL,19,Fneighbours and the wider public."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU{D@aO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/7
